 "readme": {
  "file": "README.md",
  "title": "Lean formalization of the Atiyah–Singer index theorem",
  "excerpt": "This project formalizes the classical Atiyah–Singer index theorem and its cohomological and twisted spin Dirac formulations in Lean 4, using mathlib and a library of supporting results. The main proof follows the embedding and K-theory approach in Lawson and Michelsohn's *Spin Geometry*, with supplementary arguments from the references below."
 },
